Current window context:

  Window: Summer — Notting Hill Carnival
  Dates:  2026-08-20 – 2026-08-26
  Anchor events: Notting Hill Carnival Sunday (2026-08-23), Notting Hill Carnival Monday (2026-08-24)
  Anchor dates: 2026-08-23, 2026-08-24

Character:
Europe's largest street festival transforms an entire London district for two days. The Notting Hill district is effectively impassable on Sunday and Monday — roads closed, venues either shut or operating invite-only events. Sound systems are audible across West London. Outside Notting Hill, the rest of the city runs normally and is notably quieter than usual. Rooftop bars at peak. An agent planning a Notting Hill venue on Carnival Sunday or Monday without checking the official site is making a serious scheduling error.

